## Dev-only dependencies (not shipped, therefore not listed above)

All current dependencies are development-time only: ESLint, Prettier, TypeScript,
typescript-eslint, Vitest, the Vitest coverage provider, madge, and `@types/node`.
The authoritative versions live in `package.json` (`devDependencies`) and
`pnpm-lock.yaml`. If any of these ever becomes part of a published artifact, it
must be moved into the inventory table above.
